# Line endings. Everything text is LF in the repository and in every checkout,
# so shell scripts, plists and test fixtures stay byte-identical on
# windows-latest, where Git would otherwise check them out with CRLF.
# PowerShell scripts get CRLF, their native Windows form (PowerShell reads
# either).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
